# Policy exports produced by the IntuneManagement tool (WINDOWS/, MACOS/,
# WINDOWS365/ under */IntuneManagement/<Category>/) are UTF-16LE with a BOM
# - that's what the export tool writes and what Intune re-imports cleanly.
/**/IntuneManagement/**/* diff working-tree-encoding=UTF-16LE-BOM eol=CRLF

# NativeImport/ trees (currently under MACOS/ and WINDOWS365/) hold the same
# policies re-exported in the trimmed shape used for direct Graph import,
# which is UTF-8. This rule is intentionally scoped to NativeImport/ only -
# do not remove it as "dead": both MACOS/NativeImport and WINDOWS365/NativeImport
# contain real, tracked *.json files it applies to. Verify with, e.g.:
#   git check-attr -a "MACOS/NativeImport/<any file>.json"
/**/NativeImport/*.json diff working-tree-encoding=UTF-8 eol=CRLF